{"batchcomplete":"","continue":{"gsroffset":5,"continue":"gsroffset||"},"query":{"pages":{"52325031":{"pageid":52325031,"ns":6,"title":"File:Caminandes 3 - Llamigos - Blender Animated Short.webm","index":2,"imagerepository":"local","imageinfo":[{"size":59968030,"width":1920,"height":1080,"duration":150.104,"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/ab/Caminandes_3_-_Llamigos_-_Blender_Animated_Short.webm?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","descriptionurl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Caminandes_3_-_Llamigos_-_Blender_Animated_Short.webm","descriptionshorturl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/w/index.php?curid=52325031","extmetadata":{"DateTime":{"value":"2016-10-17 11:31:29","source":"mediawiki-metadata","hidden":""},"ObjectName":{"value":"Caminandes 3 - Llamigos - Blender Animated Short","source":"mediawiki-metadata"},"CommonsMetadataExtension":{"value":1.2,"source":"extension","hidden":""},"Categories":{"value":"WebM videos|Files from external sources with reviewed licenses|Videos from YouTube|Caminandes: Llamigos|Media of the day|Videos of cartoons|Penguins in art|Uploaded with video2commons|Video display resolution 1920 x 1080|Videos of 3D animated short films|Videos of short films from 2016|Vorbis videos|VP8 videos","source":"commons-categories","hidden":""},"Assessments":{"value":"","source":"commons-categories","hidden":""},"ImageDescription":{"value":"In this episode of the Caminandes cartoon series we get to know our hero Koro even better! It's winter in Patagonia, food is getting scarce. Koro the Llama engages with Oti the pesky penguin in an epic fight over that last tasty berry.\n<p>This short 'Free Culture' animation film was made with the free 3D software Blender and funded by the subscribers of the Blender Cloud platform. Already since 2007, Blender Institute successfully combines film and media production with improving a free and open source 3D creation pipeline.\n</p><p>Currently a lot of extra material and tutorials is being produced, to share the full production with the cloud subscribers.\n</p><p>Special thanks goes to the music by Torin Borrowdale, the sfx by Sander Houtman and the render power of RenderStreet.\n</p><p>The film and all of the files that made the film are available on Blender Cloud, in Creative Commons. Get your free downloads and read more about Caminandes and our other work here:\n<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://cloud.blender.org/p/caminandes-3\">https://cloud.blender.org/p/caminandes-3</a>.\n</p><p>Release date: 29 January 2016\nDuration: 2:30 minutes\nDirector: Pablo Vazquez\nMusic: Torin Borrowdale\nSound design: Sander Houtman\nAnimation Director and Layout: Hjalti Hjalmarsson\nCharacter modeling and animation: Sarah Feldlaufer\nModeling, design, lighting, effects: Andy Goralczyk\nPipeline and production: Francesco Siddi\nStory artist: Matias Mendiola\nRigging: Juan Pablo Bouza\nSoftware support: Sergey Sharybin\n</p>\nProduced by: Ton Roosendaal","source":"commons-desc-page"},"DateTimeOriginal":{"value":"2016-01-29","source":"commons-desc-page"},"Credit":{"value":"<bdi lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><a href=\"//commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Commons:YouTube_files\" title=\"Commons:YouTube files\">YouTube</a>: <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=SkVqJ1SGeL0\"><bdi lang=\"\">Caminandes 3: Llamigos</bdi></a> \u2013 View/save archived versions on <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/*/https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=SkVqJ1SGeL0\">archive.org</a></bdi>","source":"commons-desc-page"},"Artist":{"value":"<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@BlenderOfficial\">Blender</a>","source":"commons-desc-page"},"LicenseShortName":{"value":"CC BY 3.0","source":"commons-desc-page","hidden":""},"UsageTerms":{"value":"Creative Commons Attribution 3.0","source":"commons-desc-page"},"AttributionRequir